<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Founding clubs get a say</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

    <div style="background: #111827; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #00ff90;">{{brandName}}</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 30px 20px;">
      <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Hi {{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>

      <p>We are building {{brandName}} in close partnership with the clubs that will use it. That is not a marketing line; it is how we work.</p>

      <p>Our founding clubs will have a genuine say in shaping the product. Here is what that looks like:</p>

      <div style="margin: 25px 0;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #00ff90; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 8px; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Shape the product</p>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Direct access to our team. Your feedback determines what we build and in what order.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #00ff90; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 8px; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Locked-in pricing</p>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Founding club pricing stays with you permanently, regardless of future price changes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #00ff90; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 8px; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Priority support</p>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Founding clubs always come first. Fast responses, dedicated onboarding, and hands-on help getting set up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start;">
          <div style="width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #00ff90; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 8px; margin-right: 12px; flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">Early access</p>
            <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #64748B; font-size: 14px;">Be first to use new features before they are available to anyone else.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>If you would like to chat about how {{brandName}} could work for your club, I would love to hear from you. Just reply to this email and we can set up a call.</p>

      <p>No pressure, no sales pitch. Just a conversation about what your club needs.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
        Cheers,<br>
        <strong>Mike</strong><br>
        <span style="color: #64748B;">Founder of {{brandName}}</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F8FAFC; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #64748B; font-size: 13px;">
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;">&copy; {{year}} {{brandName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color: #64748B; text-decoration: underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
